{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52786","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 王濬","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业盛王公秩，名高绦老年。\n遗荣谢珪组，得志学神仙。\n去国风爲驭，还乡海作田。\n何当曳凫舄，万里更朝天。\n（同前）（按：《新唐书》卷七二中《宰相世系表》琅邪王氏房有「濬，南昌丞。\n」其祖弘让，贞观中爲中书舍人。\n若濬长寿，亦可活至开、天之世。\n然尚无确证定爲一人，姑附识於此，以俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王濬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}